# Implementation Plan: Django & Groq AI Backend

You've elected to pivot from the mock backend to a robust, highly-performant Python backend using **Django** and **Django REST Framework (DRF)**. To power the intelligence, we will utilize the **Groq API** (known for its blazing-fast inference speeds) to classify cases and parse complex legal documents in real-time.

## User Decisions Confirmed
- **Groq Model:** We will default to `llama3-70b-8192` for high-quality legal parsing and classification logic.
- **Database:** SQLite will be used for rapid development.
- **Cleanup:** The old Node.js `backend/` folder will be completely deleted safely.

