### Phase 2: Groq AI & File Parsing Integration
This is the core functional brain of Nyaya-Stambha. Instead of simple mock algorithms, we will rely on Groq.
- **File Handlers**: Install `PyMuPDF` and `python-docx` to extract text from user-uploaded legal problem files securely.
- **Groq Classifier Services**: Construct a `classifier.py` service. It will accept incoming text, inject it into a highly rigid zero-shot prompt using the `groq` python wrapper, and force the model to respond in JSON formatting indicating the matched `category` (e.g. Family Law, Criminal Law) and `confidence` scope.

